OL,3,GNEWSANew #14m air ambulance base plan
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a new air ambulance base to
OL,7,Fserve patients in Leicestershire,
OL,8,FNorthamptonshire and Warwickshire have
OL,9,Fbeen approved.
OL,11,FThe new base for the Air Ambulance
OL,12,FService (TAAS) will be built on land
OL,13,Foff Swinford Road in Catthorpe,
OL,14,FLeicestershire.
OL,16,FIt comes after the closure of Coventry
OL,17,FAirport in June this year, where the
OL,18,Fcharity had operated from for more than
OL,19,F23 years.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
