OL,3,GNEWSANew #14m air ambulance base plan
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarborough District Council approved
OL,7,Fthe plans for the base, which will
OL,8,Finclude two helipads, a hangar,
OL,9,Ftraining facilities, rest areas and a
OL,10,Fgym, at a planning committee meeting on
OL,11,FWednesday.
